   <media:description>STUDIO COLLECTION AW26
Wonderland

Zara Studio reduces canonical pieces to clear, almost archetypal forms: cardigans, sweaters, jackets, striped roll-necks, cropped
trousers, dresses and utilitarian outerwear. Rounded shapes, compact jackets and uncomplicated proportions give the collection a
subtly nostalgic, pared-back modernism.

