   <media:description>STUDIO COLLECTION AW26
Les Nonchalants

Zara Studio menswear offers a gentler, more lived-in interpretation of familiar masculine archetypes. Tailored
jackets, cardigans, white shirts, waistcoats, leather outerwear and overcoats remain recognisable, but their
proportions and combinations are relaxed. The clothes seem to have acquired personality through use rather
than arriving pristine and complete.

