   <media:description>STUDIO COLLECTION AW26
Twilight Roses 

Zara Studio womenswear turns towards a richer, more eclectic expression of dressing. Codes associated with refinement and aristocratic wardrobes are loosened and recombined: lace, sequins, embroidery, jacquard-like surfaces, fringing and richly textured tailoring appear along-side knits, shirts and trousers. Decoration moves freely between day and evening, helping the familiar feel more personal and less prescribed.

